WEBVTT

00:04:30.245 --> 00:04:32.825
Na inahitaji kuyachukua
yale ambayo ni mambo mazuri

00:04:32.849 --> 00:04:35.110
na ushahidi mzuri wa kidunia unaotuelezea,

00:04:35.134 --> 00:04:36.967
lakini kwa kutumia taarifa za 
nchi

00:04:36.991 --> 00:04:41.712
kuweka mwanga juu ya simulizi zinazofichwa
juu ya ukatili katika nchi fulani

00:04:41.736 --> 00:04:45.228
Na kutumia taarifa hiyo
kuelekeza mwitikio wa kitaifa,

00:04:45.252 --> 00:04:48.411
lakini pia kutumia kupima
na kufuatilia maendeleo.

00:04:48.435 --> 00:04:49.752
Na kushirikisha kile
kinacholeta matokeo,

00:04:49.776 --> 00:04:52.204
kuwa wakweli
pale ambapo mambo hayatokei.

00:04:52.637 --> 00:04:54.390
Na kushirikisha hamasa

00:04:54.414 --> 00:04:57.454
pale tunapoona mafanikio
na ukatili ukipungua.

00:04:58.613 --> 00:05:01.771
Lakini je, tunaweza kufanya hili katika
ngazi ya kiulimwengu?